{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_9001_p", "source_sha256": "49f7e40e3e3202293c9980cdc1c5bdd96ab253780f4a1a9e77d1a1465c6bf635", "ja": "（今日はアイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア\n撮影日。貴音のテーマは『HIP POPレディ』だ）", "zh": "（今天是偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真拍摄日。贵音的主题是“HIP POP淑女”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_9002_008tak", "source_sha256": "8ba9c97a8a63015b194416705ca992bd6c8214ce3dbc2819c5f678d7bc291dec", "ja": "びーとに合わせ、韻を踏み想いを歌う……。\nらっぱーとは、言の葉を操る表現者なのですね。", "zh": "跟随节拍押韵，歌唱心中所想……  \n说唱歌手，原来是驾驭言语的表达者。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_9003_008tak", "source_sha256": "54fe52be568c408efe63821d0f1523c041bdeaca28ca1c8a7d53a80ab87221da", "ja": "旋律のみに頼らぬその姿勢は、まさに\n己の真を貫く強さを体現していると言えましょう。", "zh": "不依赖旋律的这种态度，正是贯彻自身真意的坚强体现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_9004_p", "source_sha256": "8aaed8519bb2748b01ffe987ff43749d09afee15953c3ae60371f9b6abc1336d", "ja": "そうだな。そういう意味でも、\n貴音にピッタリなテーマだと思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。从这个意义上说，我觉得这正是非常适合贵音的主题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_9005_008tak", "source_sha256": "1350a1549b56f528444bc1b7fc0ffd212459bc50569fba7c869de1e3c88838da", "ja": "ですが、私はらっぷに関してはまだまだ未熟です。\n無論、私なりに練習はしてきましたが……。", "zh": "但是，我在说唱方面还很不成熟。\n当然，我也按照自己的方式练习过了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_9006_p", "source_sha256": "ae812858b259b9ec78205824d2748e41274b2bb40534c71707c3f5c7e8db6e14", "ja": "よし、それなら少し試してみないか？　そうだな……\n俺とラップバトルするなんてどうだろう？", "zh": "好，既然这样，要不要先稍微试一下？我想想……\n和我来一场Rap对决怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_9008", "source_sha256": "9d0b79f910efbd06252b2cb57f6a8f8107f170dbb894a929381b266e378e13e4", "ja": "チェケラ！", "zh": "去看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_9200_p", "source_sha256": "900e7e74343e03b0c2b8f07b9273caad2e326089176068e33fe7597b82d33a70", "ja": "YOYO、貴音！　調子はどう？\n堂々巡りの不安はNo！　思いつくまま叫んでくれ！", "zh": "YOYO，贵音！近况如何？\n原地打转的不安通通No！想到什么就尽管大声喊出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_9201_008tak", "source_sha256": "53e7b37ec894d20baf8f354372892e41b5b4540a1f4bc4af642e7b6dc6cae71a", "ja": "のーのー！　私は叫ばない。曲げないすたいる、\n貫くまいらいふ。心のふれいむ、世界に届けるらいむ！", "zh": "不不！我不会喊。坚持不变的风格，贯彻到底的人生。将心中的火焰，用韵律传遍世界！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_9202_008tak", "source_sha256": "2e0f371e812049724b7ec9ecf7a6b1bdafec854f2856abb6abe3c3c3285af837", "ja": "ふふっ、いかがでしたか？　あなた様のおかげで、\n楽しくできました。よければ、もう少しお付き合いを。", "zh": "呵呵，您觉得怎么样呢？多亏了您，我才能尽情享受。要是不介意的话，还请再陪我一会儿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_9300_p", "source_sha256": "900e7e74343e03b0c2b8f07b9273caad2e326089176068e33fe7597b82d33a70", "ja": "YOYO、貴音！　調子はどう？\n堂々巡りの不安はNo！　思いつくまま叫んでくれ！", "zh": "YOYO，贵音！近况如何？\n原地打转的不安通通No！想到什么就尽管大声喊出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_9301_008tak", "source_sha256": "3b6e512ba49428a02720360fd3b3b0462bcf7874610a75300cdcadee8133bb87", "ja": "へいへい、いきなりばとる？　あなた様と戦う？\n私は願う。手を取り合う。共に目指せとっぷあいどる！", "zh": "嘿嘿，突然就要战斗了吗？要和您一战吗？  \n我所愿的是——携手并进，共同向顶尖偶像进发！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_9302_008tak", "source_sha256": "de5a49b7e5b292007dfed25f0232b6cd7416f7d992c1fbb7944865273cf3c680", "ja": "手前味噌ですが、想いは乗せられたかと……。\nぜひ、あなた様のあんさーも聞かせてください。", "zh": "虽是自卖自夸，不过……我想应该把这份心意传达出来了吧。\n还请务必也让我听听您的回答。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_9500_p", "source_sha256": "ee53f362c16ddd88f8b9a3ed04f57187d8c66e3dd9ed4f1142ca1dad93fb2275", "ja": "チェケラ！　俺はラッパー！　これが手本だ！\nリリック炸裂、ビートぶつける！　輝かせるアイドル！", "zh": "Check it out！我就是Rapper！示范就看这里！\n歌词炸裂，节拍碰撞！让偶像闪耀全场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_9501_008tak", "source_sha256": "300aceea8a8fd0abec1500b7f17ca5a1ef623093d35a65687978ad45d658f128", "ja": "闇夜も照らす、この輝き。瞬き禁止の、この戦い。\n言葉で示す、己の道！　迷わず進もう、茨の道。", "zh": "照亮暗夜的这份光辉，禁止眨眼的这场战斗。\n用言语彰显自己的道路！毫不迷惘地踏上荆棘之路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_9502_008tak", "source_sha256": "250fcc9c8eee2074b49649867ff3533fbc3191c325a1db10d7df9a5b8c6b3d8b", "ja": "ふふ、らっぷとは、真、愉快なものですね。言葉の\n響きや語感の面白みを感じられ、勉強になります。", "zh": "呵呵，说唱当真是件愉快之事呢。能够感受到词语的音韵与语感之趣，实在令我受益匪浅。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_9600_p", "source_sha256": "ee53f362c16ddd88f8b9a3ed04f57187d8c66e3dd9ed4f1142ca1dad93fb2275", "ja": "チェケラ！　俺はラッパー！　これが手本だ！\nリリック炸裂、ビートぶつける！　輝かせるアイドル！", "zh": "Check it out！我就是Rapper！示范就看这里！\n歌词炸裂，节拍碰撞！让偶像闪耀全场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_9601_008tak", "source_sha256": "5347938b33cfa233e611fb5d01d817e1973e3b689e7d0a25eb9b1db81cad5bf6", "ja": "それが手本？　りりっく単純。\nこっちが本物。揺さぶるふろう。皆のばいぶす最高潮！", "zh": "那就是范本？歌词太简单了。  \n这才是真正的。撼动人心的律动。大家的情绪冲上最高潮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_9602_008tak", "source_sha256": "f5bd2703c3d88e51c9ee08d9e83a119fb480b399e9834e3015bbf42ffb346a86", "ja": "あ、その……今のは、本意というわけでは……。\nあなた様のらっぷも、真、素晴らしきものでしたよ。", "zh": "啊，那个……我刚才并非本意……\n您的说唱也确实非常精彩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
